From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Julien Etienne <julien.etienne@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 15:00:39 -0500
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: clock: mediatek: add the MT6797 A72 cluster PLL
 index

The A72 cluster's PLL is reached through the secure firmware, by the same
MCUMIXED provider that owns the mux it shares with the other clusters.
---
 include/dt-bindings/clock/mediatek,mt6797-mcusys.h | 1 +
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+)

diff --git a/include/dt-bindings/clock/mediatek,mt6797-mcusys.h b/include/dt-bindings/clock/mediatek,mt6797-mcusys.h
index 6ed14500f..a0e02c1f1 100644
--- a/include/dt-bindings/clock/mediatek,mt6797-mcusys.h
+++ b/include/dt-bindings/clock/mediatek,mt6797-mcusys.h
@@ -5,5 +5,6 @@
 #define MT6797_CLK_MCU_LL	0	/* CPU0-3 */
 #define MT6797_CLK_MCU_L	1	/* CPU4-7 */
 #define MT6797_CLK_MCU_CCI	2
+#define MT6797_CLK_MCU_B	3	/* CPU8-9, through the secure firmware */
 
 #endif
-- 
2.43.0

